What does your working day look like?
As a Technical Service Employee, you will be responsible for maintenance, troubleshooting, and repairs for our Rotterdam location. A day in your job is always different. Of course, you can solve issues quickly and efficiently so our guests can enjoy themselves again. You are also responsible for contact with external parties working for HNH. You coordinate their work and, together with you, ensure that the hotel is always up and running. In short, a versatile and dynamic position at a unique hotel concept!

